{"id":"n71138-1-9","stage":1,"title":"이사 · 搬家","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71138-1-9-1","ko":"아무래도 집을 또 옮겨야 되겠어요.","zh":"看来我又得搬家了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"不管怎么样还是","explanation":"아무래도：不管怎么样还是。","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71331","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}},{"text":"집을","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집을","audio":"/audio/cd6aaeb8eea1e3b476ad.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又。","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"옮겨야","meaning":"搬，换，调，迁移","explanation":"옮기다：搬，换，调，迁移；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"10","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옮겨야","audio":"/audio/f6f5f62d35f5d81f6428.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠어요.","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠어요","audio":"/audio/0e39c988f6eb2cc6d6bd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f5dbee1c946c5e6b","term":"아무래도","zh":"不管怎么样还是","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3","entryId":"71331","definition":"状态或条件如何都无所谓。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"51842eae1c09c04b","term":"옮기다","zh":"搬，换，调，迁移","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3","entryId":"67843","definition":"将原来的住所、所属等换成别的。","pronunciation":["옴기다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/718f1221f0b37ad29764.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71138-1-9-2","ko":"자꾸 이사를 다니니 이웃 사람들 사귀기도 힘드네요.","zh":"总是搬来搬去，很难和邻居们建立交情呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"이사를","meaning":"搬家","explanation":"이사：搬家；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71138","senseId":"1","lemma":"이사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이사를","audio":"/audio/d48d115e5c076ef64d00.mp3"}},{"text":"다니니","meaning":"来往，走遍，","explanation":"다니다：来往，走遍，；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"4","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니니","audio":"/audio/b4796ede12feb3e1f05b.mp3"}},{"text":"이웃","meaning":"邻居，邻里","explanation":"이웃：邻居，邻里。","readings":[{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31487","senseId":"2","lemma":"이웃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들","audio":"/audio/f97fd69abf0bb02978b9.mp3"}},{"text":"사귀기도","meaning":"交，结交，交往","explanation":"사귀다：交，结交，交往；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"사귀다","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15656","senseId":"1","lemma":"사귀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사귀기도","audio":"/audio/0898fabf2082dd67a15e.mp3"}},{"text":"힘드네요.","meaning":"难，困难，费劲，难以","explanation":"힘들다：难，困难，费劲，难以；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘드네요","audio":"/audio/c4790c8f604e185eae86.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"925efb171a8616cc","term":"이사","zh":"搬家","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3","entryId":"71138","definition":"离开原先生活的地方，搬去别的地方。","pronunciation":["이사"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"来往，走遍，","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"到处走动。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"56a0fd1527d12237","term":"이웃","zh":"邻居，邻里","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3","entryId":"31487","definition":"与自己的家邻近的家；或居住在那个房子里的人。","pronunciation":["이욷"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"cdf64a5f4a894678","term":"사귀다","zh":"交，结交，交往"